{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CART FEE STATE  (Adult Signature fee — audit FIX-05, 2026-10-07)  —  Bounty Basket
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
JSON endpoint for snippets/bb-alcohol-fee-reconciler-v2.liquid, served via the Section Rendering API:

    GET /?section_id=bb-cart-fee-state

Never placed on a page. Ported from BroBasket's v2 (sections/bb-cart-fee-state.liquid), which exists
because /cart.js exposes no metafields, tags or product type — detection has to happen server-side.

THE RULE FOR THIS STORE (James, 2026-10-07): ONE FEE PER ORDER.
    any alcohol in the cart ....... 1 fee
    no alcohol in the cart ........ 0 fees
(BroBasket charges per package; this store deliberately does not.)

ALCOHOL DETECTION — cascade, same as BroBasket v2:
    line property _alcohol_signature_required == 'true'
    → product tag  contains_alcohol
    → product type Alcohol
    → custom.option_set_v2 contains 'Alcohol Signature'
Add-on lines (non-empty `For` property) and the fee line itself are never counted as alcohol.
If an alcohol product is ever missed, tag it `contains_alcohol`.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fee_product_id = 9436776136950
  assign has_alcohol = false
  assign fee_json = ''
  assign line_json = ''
  assign fee_first = true
  assign line_first = true

  for item in cart.items
    if item.product_id == fee_product_id
      assign key_json = item.key | json
      assign entry = '{"key":' | append: key_json | append: ',"quantity":' | append: item.quantity | append: ',"owner":"bb"}'
      if fee_first
        assign fee_json = entry
        assign fee_first = false
      else
        assign fee_json = fee_json | append: ',' | append: entry
      endif
      continue
    endif

    if item.properties['For'] != blank
      continue
    endif

    assign is_alcohol = false
    assign alcohol_reason = 'none'
    if item.properties['_alcohol_signature_required'] == 'true'
      assign is_alcohol = true
      assign alcohol_reason = 'property'
    endif
    unless is_alcohol
      if item.product.tags contains 'contains_alcohol'
        assign is_alcohol = true
        assign alcohol_reason = 'tag'
      endif
    endunless
    unless is_alcohol
      if item.product.type == 'Alcohol'
        assign is_alcohol = true
        assign alcohol_reason = 'product_type'
      endif
    endunless
    unless is_alcohol
      assign osv2_raw = item.product.metafields.custom.option_set_v2
      if osv2_raw != blank
        assign osv2 = osv2_raw | metafield_text
        if osv2 contains 'Alcohol Signature'
          assign is_alcohol = true
          assign alcohol_reason = 'metafield'
        endif
      endif
    endunless

    if is_alcohol
      assign has_alcohol = true
    endif

    assign key_json = item.key | json
    assign title_json = item.product_title | json
    assign entry = '{"key":' | append: key_json | append: ',"title":' | append: title_json | append: ',"alcohol":' | append: is_alcohol | append: ',"why":"' | append: alcohol_reason | append: '"}'
    if line_first
      assign line_json = entry
      assign line_first = false
    else
      assign line_json = line_json | append: ',' | append: entry
    endif
  endfor

  assign desired = 0
  if has_alcohol
    assign desired = 1
  endif
-%}
<script type="application/json" data-bb-cart-fee-state>
{
  "version": "2.0-per-order",
  "desired_fee_quantity": {{ desired }},
  "fee_lines": [{{ fee_json }}],
  "lines": [{{ line_json }}],
  "cart_item_count": {{ cart.item_count }},
  "fee_variant_id": 51099741126902,
  "fee_product_id": {{ fee_product_id }}
}
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart fee state",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
